  "_commit": {
    "id": "7038450a5807a7e717542c904c7071edf1a9df3d",
    "author": "Wanding Zhou <zhouw3@email.chop.edu>",
    "committer": "Wanding Zhou <zhouw3@email.chop.edu>",
    "message": "1.31.1: masks and probe addresses from InfiniumAnnotation v8.3 (Zenodo)\n\nEight objects, hosted on Zenodo record 23263026 (10.5281/zenodo.23263026),\nEHIDs requested:\n\n- HM450.address, EPIC.address, EPICv2.address, MSA.address: rebuilt from\n  the InfiniumAnnotation v8.3 orderings (controls as ctl_<address>_<TYPE>\n  rows, $controls NULL, $hg38 carried over). Replace EH7317, EH7323, EH8078\n  and EH10271.\n- KYCG.{HM450,EPIC,EPICv2,MSA}.Mask.20261008: the M_* mask tracks of the\n  InfiniumAnnotation .cm. They supersede KYCG.HM450.Mask.20240513,\n  KYCG.EPIC.Mask.20220123, KYCG.EPICv2.Mask.20230314 and\n  KYCG.MSA.Mask.20260122, now IN_USE FALSE.\n\nWith these and sesame >= 1.31.6, R's default QCDPB betas equal SeSAMe2's to\n~1e-15 on all four arrays (zhou-lab/sesame#1).\n\nR/sysdata.rda changes only those rows; the other 111 are identical.\n\nFix: the Zenodo fallback used before an EHID is assigned read every object\nwith load(), so an Rds object failed; it now uses readRDS for DispatchClass\nRds.\n",
    "time": 1791772980
  },
